# ECABridge is a per-machine DEVELOPER TOOL (Editor-only MCP bridge), not project content.
# It was previously a committed symlink to /Users/Shared/GH/ECABridge -- an absolute path that
# exists on one Mac. That broke macOS (dyld resolves the symlink before @loader_path, so baked
# rpaths walked into /Users/) and Windows (git checked it out as a 26-byte text stub).
# See intelligence/decisions/2026-09-10-no-committed-absolute-path-symlinks.md
# Each machine creates its own link via scripts/setup-ecabridge.sh|.bat
Plugins/ECABridge
